        "original_id": "e2111929-4f59-52a3-8a5e-5f454978af15",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Oneworld, Finnair, US Airways, American Airlines, Star Alliance\n- Places: Finland, Vantaa, Helsinki Airport\n\nFacts:\n- Oneworld is an airline alliance that was founded on 1 February 1999.\n- Finnair is the flag carrier and largest airline of Finland, and its headquarters are in Vantaa on the grounds of Helsinki Airport, which is its main hub.\n- American Airlines and US Airways merged in 2013 to create the largest airline in the world.\n- US Airways was a member of Star Alliance before becoming an affiliate member of Oneworld in March 2014.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
